  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:20px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">Moving over</span><h2>Bring the ORM code you already have.</h2></div>
    <div class="migrate">
      <a href="https://bxorm.ortusbooks.com/bxorm-2.x/getting-started/migration-from-cfml"><div class="ico"><i class="ph-duotone ph-arrows-left-right"></i></div><div><h3>Coming from CFML?</h3><p>Your persistent CFCs and ORM functions carry over. The migration guide lists the settings that were renamed or changed.</p></div></a>
      <a href="https://bxorm.ortusbooks.com/bxorm-2.x/release-history/upgrading-to-2.0.0"><div class="ico"><i class="ph-duotone ph-arrow-circle-up"></i></div><div><h3>Upgrading from BxORM 1.x?</h3><p>What's new in 2.0, and a step by step upgrade guide from Hibernate 5 to Hibernate 7. Your BIF calls keep working.</p></div></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:20px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">Ecosystem</span><h2>Part of the BoxLang family.</h2></div>
    <div class="eco"><a href="https://boxlang.io"><div class="logo"><img src="#variables.basePath#assets/ecosystem/boxlang-icon-full.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div><b>BoxLang</b><span>The modern dynamic JVM language</span></div></a><a href="https://coldbox.org"><div class="logo"><img src="#variables.basePath#assets/ecosystem/coldbox-icon-full.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div><b>ColdBox</b><span>HMVC framework, plus cborm for ORM services</span></div></a><a href="https://www.ortussolutions.com/products/commandbox"><div class="logo"><img src="#variables.basePath#assets/ecosystem/commandbox-icon-full.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div><b>CommandBox</b><span>CLI, package manager and server</span></div></a><a href="https://bxlens.boxlang.io"><div class="logo"><img src="#variables.basePath#assets/ecosystem/bxlens-icon-full.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div><b>BxLens</b><span>Observability for BoxLang apps and servers</span></div></a><a href="https://bxplaywright.boxlang.io"><div class="logo"><img src="#variables.basePath#assets/ecosystem/bxplaywright-icon-full.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div><b>BxPlaywright</b><span>Browser automation and testing</span></div></a><a href="https://github.com/ortus-boxlang/bx-sites"><div class="logo"><img src="#variables.basePath#assets/ecosystem/bxsites-icon-full.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div><b>bx-sites</b><span>The site generator behind this page</span></div></a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:20px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta">
      <h2>Your first entity is <span class="grad">five minutes</span> away.</h2>
      <p>Install the module, point it at a datasource and save your first row as an object.</p>
      <div class="install" style="margin:0 auto 22px;max-width:28em"><span class="prompt">$</span><code>bx-module install bx-orm</code><button type="button" data-copy="bx-module install bx-orm">Copy</button></div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://bxorm.ortusbooks.com/bxorm-2.x/getting-started/quick-start">Start the Quick Start <i class="ph-duotone ph-arrow-right"></i></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/ortus-boxlang/bx-orm"><i class="ph-duotone ph-github-logo"></i>Star on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

